  "briefing_dialog": [
    {
      "speaker": "Ana",
      "text": "Forgive me. I followed your hunters back here because I had to see if it was true."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Ana",
      "text": "You have CASTs. Machines that think. We have not had anything like them on Arca for centuries."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Ana",
      "text": "Mother Trinity has been silent for hundreds of years. Our tradition says her voice failed when the neutrino furnace failed \u2014 and we have not had a mind capable of repairing the furnace in living memory."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Ana",
      "text": "Your CAST \u2014 the one called Ogi \u2014 could. If he is willing."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Ana",
      "text": "If we can wake her, she may be able to help undo what was done. The Great Blank \u2014 what was lost during it \u2014 may not be lost forever."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Ana",
      "text": "Take Ogi. Take me. Let us try."
    }
  ],
